<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορτ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for a farmyard</i> (v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόρτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			):—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτὼν χ.</span>
			<i>a shaggy coat of skins</i> worn by the actor who played
			Silenus, expld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλλωτός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				7.72
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				3.40
			</span></i>: generally, <i>rough coarse coat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				707a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορταία, ἡ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>), <i>pasture</i>-land <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				2113.19
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">iv A. D.</span>, written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορτ-</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
